    "Public keys, one per line" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Öffentliche Schlüssel, einer pro Zeile"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claves públicas, una por línea"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clés publiques, une par ligne"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chiavi pubbliche, una per riga"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Публічні ключі, по одному на рядок"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An age key (age1…), an SSH key (ssh-ed25519, ssh-rsa, for example ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub) or a YubiKey key (age1tag1…, from age-plugin-yubikey). Only the matching private keys can decrypt the snapshot; the phone cannot." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein age-Schlüssel (age1…), SSH-Schlüssel (ssh-ed25519, ssh-rsa, zum Beispiel ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub) oder YubiKey-Schlüssel (age1tag1…, von age-plugin-yubikey). Nur die passenden privaten Schlüssel können den Snapshot entschlüsseln, das Handy nicht."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una clave age (age1…), SSH (ssh-ed25519, ssh-rsa, por ejemplo ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub) o YubiKey (age1tag1…, de age-plugin-yubikey). Solo las claves privadas correspondientes pueden descifrar la copia; el móvil no."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une clé age (age1…), SSH (ssh-ed25519, ssh-rsa, par exemple ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub) ou YubiKey (age1tag1…, via age-plugin-yubikey). Seules les clés privées correspondantes peuvent déchiffrer la sauvegarde, pas le téléphone."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una chiave age (age1…), SSH (ssh-ed25519, ssh-rsa, per esempio ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub) o YubiKey (age1tag1…, da age-plugin-yubikey). Solo le chiavi private corrispondenti possono decifrare lo snapshot, il telefono no."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ключ age (age1…), SSH (ssh-ed25519, ssh-rsa, наприклад ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub) або YubiKey (age1tag1…, з age-plugin-yubikey). Розшифрувати знімок можуть лише відповідні приватні ключі, телефон — ні."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The passphrase is not stored anywhere: without it, the snapshot cannot be restored." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Passphrase wird nirgends gespeichert: Ohne sie lässt sich der Snapshot nicht wiederherstellen."
